OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to tag and track prolific
OL,4,Ashoplifters in Croydon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shoplifter is caught on camera
OL,7,Fpulling bottles out of a fridge and
OL,8,Fstuffing them into his clothes on one
OL,9,Fof many CCTV videos that Ben
OL,10,FSelvaratnam has in his collection.
OL,12,FThe owner and managing director of
OL,13,FFreshfields Market in Croydon said his
OL,14,Ffamily-run grocery has at least two or
OL,15,Fthree incidents like that every day,
OL,16,Fwhich costs him hundreds of pounds a
OL,17,Fday.
OL,19,FHe said the main targets are items like
OL,20,Fwine, coffee and chocolate and the
OL,21,Fimpact on his business and staff has
OL,22,Fbeen damaging.
